note=Audited at fdfe289. Quirks flagged in the initial audit have been resolved in the following commit: (1) wrapWords made idempotent via per-phrase guard in _wrapPhrase; (2) dead code removed from text-effects.js (setupComparison method, currentVerse property); (3) docs/architecture.md updated to reflect that there is no default sheet (homepage renders when ?sheet= is absent) and to list current data files; (4) right-side comparison color now keyed on a .right class (added by buildComparisonVerse in engine.js) instead of CSS :nth-child(3). No outstanding flagged quirks.
